(27, 'https://docs.google.com/document/d/1xqWGVamvgvirrog8xLhgytHUig134arUkAk1VXMQEL0/edit', 'Fundraising Event Manager (Fundraising Team Structure - JDs, 3.2)', '["Owns the annual fundraising event calendar: strategy, scheduling and new recurring events", "Leads Flag Football, the Holiday Gift Basket Drive and the Rally Paper end to end", "Cultivates warm-pipeline sponsors and leads partner communication (Poulet Rouge, Sportira, clubs)", "Manages event budgets and tracks event revenue against fundraising goals", "Manages and coaches the Fundraising Event Coordinators"]'::jsonb),
(29, 'https://docs.google.com/document/d/1xqWGVamvgvirrog8xLhgytHUig134arUkAk1VXMQEL0/edit', 'Fundraising Event Coordinator (Fundraising Team Structure - JDs, 3.3)', '["Lays out logistics for each event: venue, equipment, signage, supplies and schedule", "Builds and maintains the day-of run-of-show for every event", "Coordinates vendors and external service providers", "Liaises with Operations for volunteer staffing and briefs volunteers on event day", "Supervises on-the-ground event operations and troubleshoots in real time"]'::jsonb),
(30, 'https://docs.google.com/document/d/1xqWGVamvgvirrog8xLhgytHUig134arUkAk1VXMQEL0/edit', 'Donor Acquisition & Communications Lead (Fundraising Team Structure - JDs, 3.6)', '["Builds and leads the volunteer Donor Ambassador team", "Face-to-face donor acquisition on campus, at events and in the community", "Owns donor onboarding and first-year stewardship", "Keeps the donor communication cadence: newsletter contributions and gratitude moments", "Front-line donor presence at fundraising events"]'::jsonb),
(28, 'https://docs.google.com/document/d/1xqWGVamvgvirrog8xLhgytHUig134arUkAk1VXMQEL0/edit', 'Outreach & Partnerships Manager (Fundraising Team Structure - JDs, 3.1)', '["Co-leads the fundraising department with the Event Manager", "Owns the sponsorship pipeline (warm and cold)", "Strategy and oversight for the recurring donor program", "Campus brand presence and university partnerships", "External representation at conferences"]'::jsonb),
(31, 'https://docs.google.com/document/d/1xqWGVamvgvirrog8xLhgytHUig134arUkAk1VXMQEL0/edit', 'Donor Engagement & Outreach Specialist (Fundraising Team Structure - JDs, 3.5)', '["Donor stewardship and retention for existing donors", "Multilingual community outreach (EN/FR/ES)", "Donor data hygiene and reporting", "Impact report drafting", "Donor presence at fundraising events"]'::jsonb),
(33, 'https://docs.google.com/document/d/1OSXzT_YE6qWwbs4IFk-QlCdcUldMRcMz0ijU__qHP9Y/edit', 'Grant Coordinator', '["Researches grant opportunities (foundations, corporations, government, PHAC) and keeps the grants database current", "Writes and submits proposals, letters of intent and applications", "Works with the executive team and program leads on narratives and budgets", "Tracks submitted proposals and prepares funder reports", "Prioritises grants that fund programs and paid staff capacity"]'::jsonb),
